    "name": "Hallowanderband",
    "steam_appid": 3127030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/d8670a7bf52ca244ff3a09e590e38c6c.avif?t=1752567282\" width=600 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treat or Trick \u2b50 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallowanderband is a rhythm-action adventure game driven by Halloween-themed stories.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fellowship of the Hallowanderband has been founded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/6045fd8ea6c97811837b199a60c4139e.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/6045fd8ea6c97811837b199a60c4139e.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/6045fd8ea6c97811837b199a60c4139e.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apprentice reaper Ryoul arrives in Hallowonderland for work, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but overwhelmed by endless tasks, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decides to pursue a long-held dream\u2014joining the Halloween parade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Ryoul\u2019s journey to form the Hallowanderband, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meeting all kinds of characters along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Happenings in the marching band</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3900306c81234217be60a82a598d601d.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3900306c81234217be60a82a598d601d.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3900306c81234217be60a82a598d601d.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the round note tracks on the left and right in time with the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy dynamic animations and immerse yourself in the colorful episodes of each character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ta-Da!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/2bf8eb917c285a2c3bfc5215c889631d.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/2bf8eb917c285a2c3bfc5215c889631d.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/2bf8eb917c285a2c3bfc5215c889631d.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever the story gets intense, a sudden event will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to overcome the 'Ta-Da' events that vary from episode to episode!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What we need is, the background story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/c71fc2823652a14f18cf6edc1369b2b0.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/c71fc2823652a14f18cf6edc1369b2b0.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/c71fc2823652a14f18cf6edc1369b2b0.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come listen to the stories your characters have to tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through dialogues, you'll get to know these fascinating characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and experience their deeper stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/d8670a7bf52ca244ff3a09e590e38c6c.avif?t=1752567282\" width=600 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treat or Trick \u2b50 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallowanderband is a rhythm-action adventure game driven by Halloween-themed stories.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Fellowship of the Hallowanderband has been founded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/6045fd8ea6c97811837b199a60c4139e.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/6045fd8ea6c97811837b199a60c4139e.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/6045fd8ea6c97811837b199a60c4139e.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apprentice reaper Ryoul arrives in Hallowonderland for work, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but overwhelmed by endless tasks, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decides to pursue a long-held dream\u2014joining the Halloween parade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Ryoul\u2019s journey to form the Hallowanderband, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meeting all kinds of characters along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Happenings in the marching band</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3900306c81234217be60a82a598d601d.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3900306c81234217be60a82a598d601d.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3900306c81234217be60a82a598d601d.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the round note tracks on the left and right in time with the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy dynamic animations and immerse yourself in the colorful episodes of each character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ta-Da!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/2bf8eb917c285a2c3bfc5215c889631d.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/2bf8eb917c285a2c3bfc5215c889631d.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/2bf8eb917c285a2c3bfc5215c889631d.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever the story gets intense, a sudden event will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to overcome the 'Ta-Da' events that vary from episode to episode!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What we need is, the background story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/c71fc2823652a14f18cf6edc1369b2b0.poster.avif?t=1752567282\" width=404 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/c71fc2823652a14f18cf6edc1369b2b0.webm?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/c71fc2823652a14f18cf6edc1369b2b0.mp4?t=1752567282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come listen to the stories your characters have to tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through dialogues, you'll get to know these fascinating characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and experience their deeper stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
